==Description==
'''Money Rain''' is a sticker that can be purchased in the store for {{Coins|200}}.

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases a happy Default Level 0 [[Crook Boss]], which is throwing cash into the air. Instead of eyes, it has two yellow dollar signs. It plays a healing sound when used.

==Trivia==
*The sound that plays when using the '''Money Rain''' sticker originates from the game ''Undertale''.
*'''Money Rain''' was given out as a physical sticker by the developers during the Roblox Developer Conference 2025.

